<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-PepsiCo Q2 EPS estimate cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-PepsiCo Q2 EPS estimate cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schroder Wertheim &amp; Co said Wednesday it cut PepsiCo Inc's earnings estimates for the second quarter.</p>
<p>Wertheim estimated that Pepsi's second-quarter earnings will be flat at about the same $0.36 per share it earned in 1996's second quarter.</p>
<p>Wertheim lowered its estimate from $0.38 per share, according to a person at Wertheim.</p>
</text>
